    "header_color": "green",
    "pages": [
      {
        "page": 1,
        "total_pages": 1,
        "content": [
          "H-ASPIRÉ — a small, closed list of",
          "words where h BLOCKS élision and",
          "liaison, even though h is silent:",
          "",
          "la honte (shame) — NOT l'honte      Press 1",
          "le héros, le haricot, le hasard",
          "",
          "Compare — most h-words are 'h muet'",
          "and elide completely normally:      Press 2",
          "l'heure, l'homme, l'hôtel, l'hiver",
          "",
          "There's no visual clue — it's just",
          "memorized per word. Cards flag it:",
          "Elides: false on the h-aspiré ones."
        ],
        "pronunciation": "Leçon douze",
        "pronunciation_mappings": {
          "1": "la honte, le héros, le haricot, le hasard",
          "2": "l'heure, l'homme, l'hôtel, l'hiver"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
