      {
        "page": 1,
        "total_pages": 2,
        "content": [
          "PASSÉ COMPOSÉ is now fully",
          "productive. MOST verbs take avoir:",
          "",
          "j'ai fini (I finished)              Press 1",
          "j'ai vendu (I sold)",
          "j'ai perdu (I lost)",
          "",
          "IRREGULAR PARTICIPLES to memorize:   Press 2",
          "faire → fait      voir → vu",
          "prendre → pris    mettre → mis",
          "dire → dit        avoir → eu",
          "être → été",
          "",
          "These come up constantly — learn",
          "them alongside the verb itself."
        ],
        "pronunciation": "Leçon treize",
        "pronunciation_mappings": {
          "1": "j'ai fini, j'ai vendu, j'ai perdu",
          "2": "fait, vu, pris, mis, dit, eu, été"
        }
      },
      {
        "page": 2,
        "total_pages": 2,
        "content": [
          "A SMALL SET OF VERBS TAKE ÊTRE —",
          "mostly motion/state. Remember them",
          "with DR & MRS VANDERTRAMP:",
          "",
          "Devenir, Revenir, Monter, Rester,   Press 1",
          "Sortir, Venir, Aller, Naître,",
          "Descendre, Entrer, Rentrer, Tomber,",
          "Retourner, Arriver, Mourir, Partir,",
          "Passer",
          "",
          "je suis arrivé(e)  (I arrived)      Press 2",
          "elle est partie    (she left)",
          "",
